                    "rawValue": 125191
                },
                "ClockSpeedMax": {
                    "label": "Max Turbo Frequency",
                    "value": "3.70 GHz",
                    "rawValue": 3700,
                    "toolTip": "Max Turbo Frequency is the maximum single-core frequency at which the processor is capable of operating using Intel® Turbo Boost Technology and, if present, Intel® Turbo Boost Max Technology 3.0 and Intel® Thermal Velocity Boost. Frequency is typically measured in gigahertz (GHz), or billion cycles per second."
                },
